  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/whitenoisepod_/status/2043015729906123055",
      "reply_text": "Jokic's numbers are insane, but Baylor's high school game was on a whole different level",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:00:35.158542+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SpursReporter/status/2043002633963610246",
      "reply_text": "Give the young guys some burn, see what they can do. It's a learning experience either way.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:01:05.717132+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/statdefender/status/2043004202264428603",
      "reply_text": "Wembanyama's dominance is no surprise, but those blocks are insane.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:01:46.499803+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Buwitre_/status/2042990187941347365",
      "reply_text": "Those close losses add up. Spurs need to close out games",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:02:28.578168+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/AlamoBuckets/status/2042989587757195448",
      "reply_text": "That's a big ask for Harrison Barnes. 19 points is a tough target.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:03:19.151435+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LakersNation/status/2042981754374377525",
      "reply_text": "That's some respect right there",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:03:49.547497+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Heat_Muse/status/2043024035957588158",
      "reply_text": "Tanking for a high pick is a tough pill to swallow",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:13:48.510220+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/OnyxOdds/status/2043011192139190525",
      "reply_text": "Impressive numbers. Jokic's all-around game is insane.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:14:39.424613+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/GilsArenaShow/status/2043020016757494091",
      "reply_text": "Giannis has been MVP twice already, so it's not like he's a mystery. He's still playing at an elite level.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:15:23.881419+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/dchinellato/status/2042997442530971820",
      "reply_text": "30 teams fighting for seeding",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:15:57.905844+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Common_Jets_Fan/status/2042989364813181395",
      "reply_text": "Not sure that's a fair comparison. Castle's defense is elite.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:16:52.918668+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LukaUpdates/status/2043030930537816137",
      "reply_text": "That's what they need. A veteran to carry the load",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:27:25.843295+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KnicksMuse/status/2043021883604455815",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, Raptors have been struggling lately. Time to capitalize.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:28:04.952037+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/isojay914/status/2043021922871452079",
      "reply_text": "That's a fair point. Brunson's path to the title is more dependent on external factors than Giannis' has been.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:28:54.581096+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ryanschumpert00/status/2043027504919634197",
      "reply_text": "Yeah his midrange has been different since January",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:29:36.522683+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/pisounalinha/status/2043005152395702590",
      "reply_text": "Interesting to see how that would've played out. AD was still developing his game back then.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:30:20.453942+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HornetsSufferer/status/2043028738913284258",
      "reply_text": "Impressive wins against some tough teams. That Denver game was a statement",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:31:13.443396+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TurnAndBurn210/status/2042992012958351663",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. Kawhi's exit still stings Spurs fans",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:31:56.141191+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DevinBookerMuse/status/2043028262029529390",
      "reply_text": "Giannis is the only one I'd expect to keep this up",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:42:38.401877+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PensareBBall/status/2043023292307574993",
      "reply_text": "Maybe his defense got stagnant, and he's been forced to adjust his game. That'd explain the drop in minutes and scoring.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:43:10.010592+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FreeVea/status/2042992506166481046",
      "reply_text": "Luka's usage rate is insane. He's always the first option.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:43:50.202972+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Topps/status/2043030805794971669",
      "reply_text": "Congrats to him on the triple double and the card. Big jump from undrafted to 2-year deal.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:55:04.329753+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MediaplatWorld/status/2043021036942184806",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about that. He was coming off the bench in the 2nd round last year.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:55:36.567176+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SleeperHeat/status/2043017005452710022",
      "reply_text": "Unreal stats for a 3rd year player. Still one of the most impressive Finals MVPs ever.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T19:56:08.322335+01:00"
    }
